    },
    {
        "text": "Deep in the alley."
    },
    {
        "text": "For the first time since a little more than a month ago, the swordsman takes a careful step outside the room and observes the area from a low angle."
    },
    {
        "text": "The alley is closely flanked by short buildings on both sides, with only a narrow opening through which to see the sky, faintly reminding her of the shrine's low ceiling."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They look like a bunch of old residences, and there's nothing special about any of them. There are a lot of things hanging from the buildings, and no good vantage points for snipers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is only one entrance and exit. Even if I had anyone tailing me, it would be difficult for them to hide themselves. That said, if I'm ambushed and find myself outnumbered, it would be just as difficult for me to escape.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "I shouldn't stay here for long\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_firemagic",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
