    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "delay": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Captain! Watch for the turrets!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flustered Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a trap! We've been had! There's too many of them, and keeping up the fight won't get us anywhere...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flustered Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get ahold of yourself! We'll fight our way out of here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "delay": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, you must fall back! We'll stay behind and buy you time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flustered Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "She opens her eyes to find no one around her."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_smithy",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "The sun shines down upon her. It's no different from the sun on that snowy day. What <i>is</i> different is the oily smell wafting into her nostrils from a shop facing the street."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_032",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lou Ban, how come you're stir-frying vegetables this early in the day?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passerby Diner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_005"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I'd change things up a little. Youngsters these days wake up pretty late, to the point that they have breakfast and lunch in one meal. Might as well follow the trends, don't you think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Breakfast Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down... I mustn't lose my composure because of my past mistakes... Calm down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_005"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lass, you haven't had anything to eat, have you? Want something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Breakfast Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter how much of a rush you're in. You still gotta eat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Breakfast Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Your average hole-in-the-wall eatery. Both the owner and the patrons are normal folk. I sense no threat from them whatsoever.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Perhaps I can stave my hunger here.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you serve?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_005"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dau zeong, jau zaa gwai, bao, caau min. You name it, I got it. All our customers say we have the best cheongfun in town. Want to give it a try?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Breakfast Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "(These Yanese manjuu have some kind of filling inside... and who knows where they got these strange sauces. The aroma is enough to make one's mind waver...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "(No... This doesn't sound safe. I should look for something safer to eat.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "300,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
