    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_032"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was with that girl just now? Maybe she's not carrying any cash?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Passerby Diner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_005"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's an unfamiliar face. Might not live nearby.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Breakfast Stall Owner"
    },
    {
        "text": "She looked pretty malnourished, too. Must've been some time since she had a proper meal. *sigh* If she was really that tight on money, I could've treated her to something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Breakfast Stall Owner"
    },
    {
