    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_horn",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The port."
    },
    {
        "text": "As one of the city's most important ports of entry, it is also one of the places with the greatest foot traffic. If her handler were here, this is probably where she'd find him."
    },
    {
        "text": "The swordsman stands at a high vantage point and looks into the distance. Large ships are swallowing up and disgorging large amounts of cargo and passengers, stopping briefly before sailing away just as quickly."
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps one of these ships could also take her straight to Higashi..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... It is far too soon for me to return.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have been exiled as a defeated general, and have accomplished nothing since. Even if I do return home, I have no right to face Master...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_272_strong_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ma'am... Sorry, but you're stepping on my boxes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Sorry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_272_strong_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Want to buy some fins?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have all kinds, caught fresh just today. I can cut them for you, or make them into sashimi, if you like.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sashimi... a familiar dish.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "(No extraneous preparations and no unnecessary seasonings. A safe dish.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'll buy a fin. Make it sashimi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_272_strong_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You got it. One serving of sashimi, coming right up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
