        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(A hawker has such fine skills?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "(It's an ordinary boning knife, but he wields it with such accuracy and finesse. The strength he puts into his arm and the angle at which he's slicing into the meat both align with the principles of swordsmanship.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such amazing knife skills...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's your name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who taught you your knife techniques? What is the name of the school? Does the blade itself have a history?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_272_strong_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ma'am... are you asking me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "text": "The name's Jaye. I'm a seafood hawker, and my uncle taught me how to use a knife.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "text": "This one's used for cutting fins, and it's never sliced anything else. As for the technique... I mean, it takes all kinds of different knives and techniques to process shellshrimps and fins...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So it's a school that practices its techniques behind closed doors... How formidable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "I once met a swordsman who trained for ten years only by cutting straw mats at the shrine. It doesn't matter how ordinary a technique is. Once mastered, the force that can be unleashed is no less potent than any other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "You possess such fine skills, yet find yourself working as a fin hawker... You must also be a swordsman yet to find success. It seems misery loves company.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me ask you. What are your ambitions? Who will you serve with your prowess?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_272_strong_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'm not a very ambitious fella...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the short term, I want to drive up business, make more money, and get a bigger storefront as soon as possible...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would you say that? Don't you feel your knife skills are going to waste when you use them only to cut these small fry?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_272_strong_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Small fry? Does she think this fin is too small?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... I have bigger fins too, of course. They're sold by weight. I'm not trying to shortchange you or anything. Just worried it'd be too much for you to eat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Not only are his words riddled with hidden meanings, he is questioning me through my <i>appetite</i>?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Surely you jest? 'My skills and techniques are as immense as my appetite.' A single fin is hardly enough to satiate my hunger! Bring me the largest fin you have!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_272_strong_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, okay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Here to pick up an order.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "One grass fin, three <i>kan</i> of shellshrimp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cold Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_272_strong_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yup, all ready to go. Here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Seafood Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
