    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "With light footsteps at a brisk pace, a familiar silhouette passes by in the crowd, like a fin that suddenly leapt from the water before submerging itself in the river just as quickly, leaving not a trace."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That outfit... A ninja from the Southern Court? What are they doing here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop right there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$swordtsing4",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$swordtsing5",
        "volume": 0.9,
        "delay": 0.15,
        "channel": "a"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My Lord! My apologies for my tardiness in coming to your defense. Is everything okay?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Prudent Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "These ninja... They plot to assassinate you again and again... Despicable scoundrels! They know they can never defeat you on the battlefield, so they resort to these craven methods!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Akafuyu, do you know why these men want me dead?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Prudent Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I do. You are a senior minister of the Kougon clan and its bravest commander. They fear you, and as such wish you harm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, that reason belongs to those who sent them, not to the men themselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Prudent Voice"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is sad is that those who lie at our feet lifeless never found a reason, even unto death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Prudent Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Akafuyu, you must not be like them."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
