        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A long street."
    },
    {
        "text": "After a lengthy chase, it is already nighttime."
    },
    {
        "text": "The streets are lined with bright lights, and there is a sea of colorfully illuminated signs and tall buildings. She can hear cheers and laughter from the passersby all around her. Is it perhaps a holiday here in this strange, foreign land?"
    },
    {
        "text": "The swordsman stands alone in the tide of pedestrians, like a reef continuously struck by the waves. The target she was following has long since vanished without a trace."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Did they plan ahead of time to lure me here...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Assassination in a busy marketplace. Typical of those wretched ninjas... It's their favorite trick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back alley brawls are not my forte, but losing the will to fight would only give them an opening.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are they...!?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The swordsman grips tightly onto her sword's hilt and concentrates in an attempt to locate that faint hint of danger among the clamor, only to come up short."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 15,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_swordexsheath"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Who goes there\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_033"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bro! That outfit's so cool! It's just like the real thing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Akafuyu turns around to find a young man fondling her shoulderguards with twinkling, excited eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "The swordsman is about to snap, but the innocent look on his face seems strange and foreign\u2014How could a commoner be so unafraid to approach a fully-armored bushi?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you not afraid of me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Afraid? Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Youth"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't today the day that <i>Nanboku Fuuunden</i> preorders are open? How did you get the outfit's design already? Oh, I get it. You're an official cosplayer, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Youth"
    },
    {
        "text": "That armor... You're a swordsman of the Kougon clan from the Northern Court, right? I heard the Northern swordsmen have high base stats, and the Southern ninjas have more maneuverability, but I think the swordsmen's gear is way cooler!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What exactly are you talking about...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, ninja? You saw a ninja?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_033",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. Look over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Akafuyu looks in the direction the young man is pointing. The colorful lights are dizzying. With great effort, she manages to focus her gaze on a big screen in the video game store on the side of the road."
    },
    {
        "text": "The character in the game is equipped with a set of armor and a sword that both look almost exactly like hers, and is unleashing all sorts of moves she is incapable of to mow down exaggerated numbers of enemies."
    },
    {
        "text": "The enemies on the screen scream as their flesh and blood fly in all directions. Likewise, the audience on the other side of the screen are screaming with joy and excitement."
    },
    {
        "text": "She notices her reflection on the crystal clear display window, looking like an absurd outsider."
    },
    {
        "text": "Suddenly, the swordsman laughs."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a lucky guy, living here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drawsword"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you'll never have to be scared of this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "But remember. This isn't cool at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
