    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "posfrom": "150,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Akafuyu?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This logo... Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We ran into some trouble on the way here, and it took us longer than expected to arrive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry for the wait. How has life been here? Ran into any problems?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is a strange place, but an interesting one nonetheless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait. Are you from Ursus?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*... I put on a disguise to avoid trouble. Did my accent give it away? Fine, yes, I'm from Ursus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "They have contact with Higashi, and they hire Ursus...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "text": "What sort of place is this 'Rhodes Island'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A peaceful place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "There, you'll find Ursus, Higashinese, Kazimierzians, and Leithanians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not saying that we make everyone pretend that all those unpleasant things never happened. It's just that we don't operate on a logic based on hatred and violence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I was told that I still had a chance to fight as a swordsman with Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_090",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you will. There are many excellent warriors like you aboard. We're a pharmaceutical company, but sometimes you need to fight to save lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "But most of the time, everyone spends their time doing normal things. Eating, drinking tea, and figuring out ways to avoid situations where we have to fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_475_akafyu_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Akafuyu"
